#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:5
#: ce2309d4d00644a6b0883b342a008456
msgid "Compass Calibration"
msgstr "罗盘校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:7
#: 1c8affd58ebb4c8b8c5309b1e169b66f
msgid ""
"Operation of fixed wing Planes and some Rovers is possible without the use "
"of a compass (See :ref:`common-compassless`), but utilizing a compass is "
"recommended for all other vehicles unless yaw is provided by some other "
"means (:ref:`common-gps-for-yaw` or :ref:`common-non-gps-navigation-landing-"
"page` or :ref:`common-external-ahrs`)"
msgstr ""
"固定翼飞机和部分漫游车可以在不使用罗盘的情况下运行（参见 :ref:`common-"
"compassless`），但建议所有其他飞行器使用罗盘，除非通过其他方式提供偏航（:ref:`common-gps-for-yaw` 或 "
":ref:`common-non-gps-navigation-landing-page` 或 :ref:`common-external-ahrs`）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:9
#: 6b69c8d23b004f919be83f6599997e00
msgid ""
"This article explains how to perform basic compass calibration. It assumes "
"that you have at least one compass, either internally or externally in the "
"system, and it has been enabled. See :ref:`Advanced Compass Setup <common-"
"compass-setup-advanced>` for more information and to setup other compass "
"related features."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何执行基本罗盘校准。文章假设您的系统中至少有一个罗盘（内置或外置），并且已启用。有关更多信息以及设置其他罗盘相关功能，请参阅 "
":ref:`Advanced Compass Setup <common-compass-setup-advanced>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:11
#: 8fe58415d1874159984a805b46a437da
msgid ""
"It is important that when compass calibration is done, the vehicle have a "
"good 3D gps lock, in order to assure the best setup. If necessary, move "
"outdoors in order to get a good 3D gps lock before doing the compass "
"calibration."
msgstr ""
"重要的是，在进行罗盘校准时，飞行器应获得良好的 3D GPS 定位锁定，以确保最佳设置效果。如有必要，请移至室外以获得良好的 3D GPS "
"锁定，然后再进行罗盘校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:15
#: ee602a9e1c404abaa00fb09387646a61
msgid "Compass calibration cannot be performed while vehicle is armed."
msgstr "飞行器处于解锁状态时无法执行罗盘校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:18
#: 142fecf0486e44beac27ab28b1ce84c9
msgid ""
"It is not necessary to recalibrate the compass when the vehicle is flown at "
"a new location because ArduPilot includes a \"world magnetic model\" which "
"allows converting the location's magnetic North to true North without "
"recalibrating .  In addition the location's \"inclination\" is calibrated at"
" startup and then again soon after takeoff."
msgstr ""
"当飞行器在新地点飞行时，无需重新校准罗盘，因为 ArduPilot "
"包含「世界磁场模型」，该模型无需重新校准即可将当地磁北转换为真北。此外，当地的「磁倾角」会在启动时进行校准，并在起飞后不久再次校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:21
#: 5d086613d0e847e9b6c3f7ed13efc8ba
msgid "Calibration first steps"
msgstr "校准初始步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:24
#: 5e914bee9c6240fe9d054831b8d68eae
msgid ""
"Do not calibrate the compasses near any metallic or magnetic field producing"
" object (computers, cell phones, metal desks, power supplies, etc.) or "
"incorrect calibration will occur."
msgstr "请勿在任何金属或产生磁场的物体附近（计算机、手机、金属桌面、电源等）校准罗盘，否则会导致校准不正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:27
#: 97f5491911b841d0b1cdeb8d2aff2378
msgid "Under **SETUP\\| Mandatory Hardware** select **Compass**."
msgstr "在 **SETUP\\| Mandatory Hardware** 下选择 **Compass**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:32
#: eaf5b6c1101a41d8bb7ca208f34c9c3d
msgid "Mission Planner: Compass Calibration"
msgstr "Mission Planner：罗盘校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:34
#: f0af265d167a4d8b8d0434684d596c66
msgid ""
"You may wish to disable any internal compasses if you are consistently "
"seeing the \"inconsistent compasses\" pre-arm message often and you are sure"
" that the external compass is calibrated."
msgstr "如果您经常看到「罗盘不一致」的预解锁提示，并且确定外置罗盘已校准，则可以考虑禁用所有内置罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:39
#: 2df7a868955d42e7917403993da8a779
msgid "Onboard Calibration"
msgstr "机载校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:41
#: 9a0a36ce5ca74586831000a2ec024f1b
msgid ""
"\"Onboard Calibration\" is a calibration routine that runs on the autopilot."
"  This method is more accurate than the older \"Offboard Calibration\" (aka "
"\"Live Calibration\") which runs on the ground station because in addition "
"to offsets, scaling and orientation are also automatically determined."
msgstr ""
"「机载校准」是在飞控上运行的校准程序。此方法比旧版「离板校准」（又称「实时校准」，在地面站上运行）更精确，因为除偏移量外，还会自动确定缩放比例和方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:43
#: cd5cd46f0cea4826bb283ba481984af9
msgid ""
"Calibration could fail for the compasses integrated into the autopilot, if "
"any,  if the :ref:`autopilot board orientation<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` parameter "
"is not correct."
msgstr ""
"如果 :ref:`autopilot board orientation<AHRS_ORIENTATION>` "
"参数设置不正确，飞控中集成的罗盘（如有）校准可能会失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:45
#: 770e1938342a436a92dabc474321d9ef
msgid "To perform the onboard calibration of all compasses:"
msgstr "要执行所有罗盘的机载校准："

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:47
#: 3b1bc597d84e4fb7b4bbff62e9017975
msgid "click the \"Onboard Mag Calibration\" section's \"Start\" button"
msgstr "点击「Onboard Mag Calibration」部分的「Start」按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:48
#: 614168164acf4a0688d8594f1b7dd341
msgid ""
"if your autopilot has a buzzer attached you should hear a single tone "
"followed by short beep once per second"
msgstr "如果您的飞控连接了蜂鸣器，您应该会听到一声单音，然后每秒一声短促的蜂鸣声"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:49
#: 50811a2f6b3b4a93810276b6bead7316
msgid ""
"hold the vehicle in the air and rotate it so that each side (front, back, "
"left, right, top and bottom) points down towards the earth for a few seconds"
" in turn. Consider a full 360-degree turn with each turn pointing a "
"different direction of the vehicle to the ground. It will result in 6 full "
"turns plus possibly some additional time and turns to confirm the "
"calibration or retry if it initially does not pass."
msgstr ""
"将飞行器举起并旋转，使每个面（前、后、左、右、上、下）依次朝向地面几秒钟。考虑进行完整的 360 度旋转，每次旋转时飞行器的不同方向朝向地面。这将导致 "
"6 次完整旋转，以及可能的一些额外时间和旋转，以确认校准或在初次未通过时重试。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:54
#: e75d6f7fec204c3493705bc18998b475
msgid ""
"as the vehicle is rotated the green bars should extend further and further "
"to the right until the calibration completes"
msgstr "随着飞行器的旋转，绿色进度条应不断向右延伸，直到校准完成"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:55
#: 893cbac4aeda4a5080da1cc0391c21b6
msgid ""
"upon successful completion three rising tones will be emitted and a \"Please"
" reboot the autopilot\" window will appear and you will need to reboot the "
"autopilot before it is possible to arm the vehicle."
msgstr "成功完成后，将发出三声上升音调，并出现「请重启飞控」窗口，您需要重启飞控才能解锁飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:58
#: 68673a3ba3004ab8991a5115d908ad4b
msgid "If calibration fails:"
msgstr "如果校准失败："

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:60
#: bf6d154a0b27418d8b167e3dc882239c
msgid ""
"you will hear an \"unhappy\" failure tone, the green bars may reset to the "
"left, and the calibration routine may restart (depending upon the ground "
"station). Mission Planner will automatically retry, so continue to rotate "
"the vehicle as instructed above."
msgstr ""
"您将听到「不满意」的失败音调，绿色进度条可能重置到左侧，校准程序可能会重新开始（取决于地面站）。Mission Planner "
"将自动重试，请按照上述说明继续旋转飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:61
#: 3ed153b773384321b129ba9a23d4334e
msgid ""
"if a compass is not calibrating, consider moving to a different area away "
"from magnetic disturbances, and remove electronics from your pockets."
msgstr "如果某个罗盘无法校准，请考虑移动到远离磁干扰的不同区域，并取出口袋中的电子设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:62
#: 82a7f0c2b9c545e29fb346af3f9b3183
msgid ""
"if, after multiple attempts, the compass has not passed the calibration, "
"Press the \"Cancel\" button and change the \"Fitness\" drop-down to a more "
"relaxed setting and try again."
msgstr "如果经过多次尝试后，罗盘仍未通过校准，请按「Cancel」按钮，将「Fitness」下拉菜单更改为更宽松的设置，然后重试。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:63
#: 62a2459e01314227ba242160c6526677
msgid ""
"if compass calibration still fails it may help to raise "
":ref:`COMPASS_OFFS_MAX <COMPASS_OFFS_MAX>` from 850 to 2000 or even 3000"
msgstr ""
"如果罗盘校准仍然失败，可以尝试将 :ref:`COMPASS_OFFS_MAX <COMPASS_OFFS_MAX>` 从 850 提高到 2000 "
"甚至 3000"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:64
#: bf7a04e8b20f4cb2bb50a1a5c5e91053
msgid ""
"finally, if a single compass is not calibrating and you trust the others, "
"disable it."
msgstr "最后，如果某个罗盘无法校准而您信任其他罗盘，请将其禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:67
#: d71c5b4fb7684a2eb4b63c7ef3c5fe6f
msgid "Onboard Calibration using RC Switch"
msgstr "使用遥控开关进行机载校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:69
#: 6fadb765a6a94a00b454cd26a8e34676
msgid ""
"Onboard Calibration can be started using an RC switch instead using the "
"Mission Planner technique above. This allows calibrating without the tangle "
"of the USB cable."
msgstr "机载校准可以使用遥控开关启动，而不必使用上述 Mission Planner 方法。这样可以避免 USB 线缆的缠绕进行校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:71
#: d8c48e8da7484a4e963ee237281e2f74
msgid ""
"Setup an RC channel to start the calibration by setting its ``RCx_OPTION`` "
"to be \"171\". A high value on the channel will start calibrating all "
"compasses and you would move the vehicle as above. A low value will cancel "
"the calibration. The tones for success or failure above will be emitted."
msgstr ""
"通过将遥控通道的 ``RCx_OPTION`` "
"设置为「171」来设置该通道以启动校准。该通道的高电平值将开始校准所有罗盘，您可以按上述方式移动飞行器。低电平值将取消校准。成功或失败的音调将被发出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:76
#: b4b473db522943f0b32b27de1ecb1789
msgid "Large Vehicle MagCal"
msgstr "大型飞行器 MagCal"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:78
#: 836d8589e16544c9a8dd4b10aae704f0
msgid ""
"Large or heavy vehicles are impractical to rotate on all axis. This feature "
"allows a fairly accurate calibration if GPS lock is active on the autopilot "
"and the vehicles actual heading is known, either using a landmark reference "
"on the Mission Planner map, or using another compass (eg cell phone) and "
"entering the vehicles heading."
msgstr ""
"大型或重型飞行器在所有轴上旋转不切实际。如果飞控上的 GPS 已锁定，并且已知飞行器的实际航向（可通过 Mission Planner "
"地图上的地标参考，或使用另一个罗盘（如手机）并输入飞行器航向），则此功能可实现相当精确的校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:80
#: 8044e4b47ad448828659057d210a0844
msgid ""
"The proper orientation of the compass must also be set in order for this "
"method to give a good result.  If orientation is incorrect this procedure "
"will appear to succeed while leaving the compass calibration in a very bad "
"state."
msgstr "罗盘的正确方向也必须正确设置，此方法才能获得良好结果。如果方向不正确，此程序看似会成功，但实际上会使罗盘校准处于非常糟糕的状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:82
#: d1c7caa567894de38427b6c1dcbb8647
msgid ""
"the heading entered should be TRUE, not MAGNETIC. Using a phone's compass "
"app will usually required adding the local declination value to the reading "
"in order to obtain the TRUE geographic heading which should be entered."
msgstr "输入的航向应为真北，而非磁北。使用手机的罗盘应用通常需要在读数上加上当地磁偏角值，才能获得应输入的真实地理航向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:85
#: 820f7701e6c043d5a260b192f996251a
msgid "Compass Ordering"
msgstr "罗盘排序"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:87
#: c2fdd9cf79724fbc8ec2b67b14751534
msgid ""
"At the top of the page, you can change the priority of the attached "
"compasses, if desired."
msgstr "在页面顶部，您可以根据需要更改已连接罗盘的优先级。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:90
#: 6fd2b41d997840079a32a48a2b6d28e8
msgid "Additional information"
msgstr "附加信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:92
#: cfbe4d305c6f445ebecc9f28616f6f00
msgid ""
"More information about compass configuration can be found in :ref:`Advanced "
"Compass Setup <common-compass-setup-advanced>`. This includes instructions "
"for how to set up additional compasses, :ref:`automatic setting of "
"offsets<automatic-compass-offset-calibration>`, non-standard compass "
"alignments, :ref:`compassmot <copter:common-compass-setup-"
"advanced_compassmot_compensation_for_interference_from_the_power_wires_escs_and_motors>`,"
" etc."
msgstr ""
"有关罗盘配置的更多信息，请参阅 :ref:`Advanced Compass Setup <common-compass-setup-"
"advanced>`。其中包括如何设置额外罗盘、:ref:`自动设置偏移量<automatic-compass-offset-"
"calibration>`、非标准罗盘对准、:ref:`compassmot <copter:common-compass-setup-"
"advanced_compassmot_compensation_for_interference_from_the_power_wires_escs_and_motors>`"
" 等说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:94
#: 6bddcf5954504e4d852c41116ff6f396
msgid ""
"General discussion on magnetic interference and ways to reduce it can be "
"found in :ref:`Magnetic Interference <common-magnetic-interference>`."
msgstr ""
"有关磁干扰及减少磁干扰方法的一般讨论，请参阅 :ref:`Magnetic Interference <common-magnetic-"
"interference>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:98
#: e930e4d47580450290d9fb5125156962
msgid "Video demonstration"
msgstr "视频演示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner.rst:100
#: a5e484a38cff49358793d880fd8c567b
msgid "Video demonstrations of compass calibration."
msgstr "罗盘校准的视频演示。"
